<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63550" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίπος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό</span>,
		prop. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>animal fat, lard,
			tallow</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Long.</u>
				467a3
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				935b20
			</span></i>: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χηνὸς λίπη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.377.8
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Pall.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βεβρῶτες αἵματος λ.</span>
			gorged with <i>fat</i> and blood, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1022
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. αἵματος</span>
			<i>a fleck</i> of blood, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1428
			</span></i> (lyr., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίβος</span> Casaub.); of
			vegetable oil, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. ἐλαίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					398
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.18.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.7.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				39
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίπα, λιπαρός, λιπάω,
				λιπαίνω</span>, Skt. <i>lip</i>- 'anoint', Lith.
			<i>lipti</i> 'stick'.)</div>
